<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2093241816"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1713150265"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="いってらっしゃい"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ヒグチアイ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="いってらっしゃい"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:55.433"><div begin="00:13.436" end="03:46.821"><p begin="00:13.436" end="00:18.925" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">ずっと探してた 捧げた心臓の在処<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直在寻找着 献出的心脏最终的归宿</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to sa ga shi te ta sa sa ge ta shi n zo u no a ri ka</span></p><p begin="00:19.056" end="00:26.326" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">本当の想いを教えて 夢物語でいいから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我你真实的想法吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n to u no o mo i wo o shi e te</span></p><p begin="00:26.326" end="00:31.926" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">最後になにがしたい？どこに行きたい？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最后你还有什么想做的事情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa i go ni na ni ga shi ta i ？</span></p><p begin="00:31.926" end="00:35.707" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">わたしはね 帰りたいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我啊 想要回去了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi wa ne ka e ri ta i yo</span></p><p begin="00:35.707" end="00:41.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">一緒の家に帰ろうよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回到我们共同的那个家</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i 's sho no i e ni ka e ro u yo</span></p><p begin="00:41.560" end="00:47.849" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">もしも明日がくるのなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果说 明天还会如期到来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo shi mo a shi ta ga ku ru no na ra</span></p><p begin="00:47.849" end="00:54.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">あなたと花を育てたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我好想和你一起栽种花朵</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta to ha na wo so da te ta i</span></p><p begin="00:54.280" end="01:00.549" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">もしも明日がくるのなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果说 明天还会如期到来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo shi mo a shi ta ga ku ru no na ra</span></p><p begin="01:00.549" end="01:06.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">あなたと愛を語りたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我好想向你诉说爱的意义</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta to a i wo ka ta ri ta i</span></p><p begin="01:06.880" end="01:13.313" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">走って 笑って 転んで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一起奔跑 一起欢笑 一起跌倒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha shi 't te wa ra 't te ko ro n de</span></p><p begin="01:13.313" end="01:18.682" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">迷って 庇って 抱いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一起迷茫 相互依靠 紧紧相拥</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma yo 't te ka ba 't te i da i te</span></p><p begin="01:18.682" end="01:21.933" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">また会えるよね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们还会再见的 对吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta a e ru yo ne</span></p><p begin="01:21.933" end="01:27.053" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">おやすみ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">晚安</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o ya su mi</span></p><p begin="01:36.636" end="01:42.289" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">ずっと気付いてた 強がりだらけのあなたが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">早在很久以前我就发觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to ki zu i te ta</span></p><p begin="01:42.289" end="01:51.067" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">たどり着いた答えの先に 大人になっていたこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在几经辗转寻找到答案之时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta do ri tsu i ta ko ta e no sa ki ni</span></p><p begin="02:15.255" end="02:18.510" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">掴んだ手を振り払って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你奋力地甩开了我紧握不放的手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu ka n da te wo fu ri ha ra 't te</span></p><p begin="02:18.510" end="02:21.635" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">強さと孤独を手に取った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">获得了力量的同时也获得了孤独</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu yo sa to ko do ku wo te ni to 't ta</span></p><p begin="02:21.635" end="02:24.943" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">大きく羽ばたき空の向こう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">张开自由的翅膀飞向天空的彼端</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o o ki ku ha ba ta ki so ra no mu ko u</span></p><p begin="02:24.943" end="02:28.094" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">やっと今手が届いた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻你终于触及了那片天空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya 't to i ma te ga to do i ta</span></p><p begin="02:28.094" end="02:31.245" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">わたしの胸に耳を当てて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请贴近我的胸膛侧耳倾听</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi no mu ne ni mi mi wo a te te</span></p><p begin="02:31.245" end="02:36.620" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">あなたはずっとここにいる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你永远都会存在于我心里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta wa zu 't to ko ko ni i ru</span></p><p begin="02:36.620" end="02:42.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">ほらね 鼓動が聞こえる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对吧 能听见心脏的声音吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ra ne ko do u ga ki ko e ru</span></p><p begin="02:44.685" end="02:50.858" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">もしも明日がくるのなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果说 明天还会如期到来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo shi mo a shi ta ga ku ru no na ra</span></p><p begin="02:50.858" end="02:57.508" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">あなたと花を育てたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我好想和你一起栽种花朵</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta to ha na wo so da te ta i</span></p><p begin="02:57.508" end="03:03.684" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">もしも明日がくるのなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果说 明天还会如期到来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo shi mo a shi ta ga ku ru no na ra</span></p><p begin="03:03.684" end="03:10.131" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">あなたと愛を語りたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我好想向你诉说爱的意义</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta to a i wo ka ta ri ta i</span></p><p begin="03:10.131" end="03:16.471" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">走って 笑って 転んで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一起奔跑 一起欢笑 一起跌倒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha shi 't te wa ra 't te ko ro n de</span></p><p begin="03:16.471" end="03:21.888" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">迷って 庇って 抱いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一起迷茫 相互依靠 紧紧相拥</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma yo 't te ka ba 't te i da i te</span></p><p begin="03:21.888" end="03:25.135" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">また会えるよね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们还会再见的 对吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta a e ru yo ne</span></p><p begin="03:25.135" end="03:29.464" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">おやすみ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">晚安</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o ya su mi</span></p><p begin="03:30.149" end="03:35.966" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">ずっと探してた 捧げた心臓の在処<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直在寻找着 献出的心脏最终的归宿</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to sa ga shi te ta sa sa ge ta shi n zo u no a ri ka</span></p><p begin="03:35.966" end="03:46.821" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">こんなところにあったんだ あなたの心臓のそばに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">原来它就在这样的地方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na to ko ro ni a 't ta n da</span></p></div></body></tt>